    "你的数据会留在团队(归公司),你将无法再访问。" : {

    },
    "你说的话被识别成 from(左边)→ AI 修文本之前先替换为 to(右边)→ 存的就是 to。\n\n例子: 打 con → 打 concrete · 走 RFI → 提交 RFI · 出 ITP → 准备 ITP\n\n大小写敏感。同 from 重复加会**覆盖**旧的。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What you say is recognised as `from` (left) → replaced with `to` (right) before AI cleanup → the stored value is `to`.\n\nExamples: 打 con → 打 concrete · 走 RFI → submit RFI · 出 ITP → prepare ITP\n\nCase sensitive. Adding the same `from` again **overrides** the old entry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你还没有团队" : {

    },
    "例如: 安全日检" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
