    "这些词会让语音识别**更准**(听到时优先匹配)+ AI 修文本时**不瞎改**(保留原样)。\n\n适合加:你公司/工地的专属称呼、自家产品名、上级单位、本地俚语等系统不知道的词。\n\n基础词典(澳洲工地通用 100+ 词)已经内置,**不用重复加** AS4000 / RFI / 钢筋 / concrete 这些。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These terms make speech recognition more accurate (matched first) and stop AI from rewriting them.\n\nAdd: company-specific names, product names, supervisors, local slang the system doesn't know.\n\nA built-in dictionary (100+ Australian construction terms) is already included — no need to re-add AS4000 / RFI / Rebar / Concrete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
