    "锁屏一键完成会让人误触,工地手套/雨水/汗水都是误触源。必须打开 App 看清楚再点完成。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One-tap complete on the lock screen leads to mistaps — site gloves, rain, and sweat all cause them. You must open the app and check before marking done."
